cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the archived release of this analysis when reusing the code or data. Release DOI pending."
type: software
title: "BurnPro3D prescribed-fire DOE analysis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis and figure reproduction for a 1,600-run prescribed-fire simulation
  ensemble. DOE means design of experiments. The package reproduces treatment
  summaries from saved simulation outputs and does not include a complete
  workflow for rerunning the original QUIC-Fire simulations.
